*> vybe-test: cobol/level88_transition/level88_in_compute_guard
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_level88_transition.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 DENOM PIC 9 VALUE 0.
    88 NONZERO VALUE 1 THRU 9.
01 R PIC 9(3) VALUE 0.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    IF NONZERO
        COMPUTE R = 100 / DENOM
    ELSE
        DISPLAY "DIV BY ZERO GUARDED"
    END-IF.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING "DIV BY ZERO GUARDED" DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "DIV BY ZERO GUARDED"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [DIV BY ZERO GUARDED] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

